2:T69e,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"Who is Naitik Baldaniya?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Naitik Baldaniya is the founder of PlanBot, an AI daily planner app, and the founder of PlannextTech (2024). Born 28 August 2009 in Gujarat, India, he started coding at 12, began building PlanBot in May 2024 at age 14, and launched it on Google Play on 1 March 2026. He is completing a Diploma in IT in Ahmedabad, class of 2027."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How old is the founder of PlanBot?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Naitik Baldaniya was born on 28 August 2009, which makes him 17 years old. He started PlanBot when he was 14 and released it publicly at 16."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"When was PlanBot launched?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"PlanBot launched on Google Play on 1 March 2026, after roughly 22 months of development. As of September 2026 it has 331 downloads, a 4.7-star rating from 18 reviews, and users in India, the US, and Germany."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is PlanBot profitable?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Not yet, and the founder says so openly. In August 2026, keeping the server running 24/7 for about 10 active users cost around Rs 2,000 - a lesson in unit economics that shaped how he builds. PlanBot is currently focused on growth, not revenue."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What is PlannextTech?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"PlannextTech is the software studio Naitik Baldaniya founded in 2024 in Gujarat, India. PlanBot is its first and only product - built by a solo founder with no funding, no employees, and no office."}}]}a:["slug","naitik-baldaniya-planbot-founder","d"]
